{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions","id":345693,"title":"Show of power - power questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-20T05:44:44-08:00","id":345693,"title":"Show of power - power questions","content":"Hi<br /> Got a question about the exploit: Show of power (or more like a few questions that come down to a single one): What does it do / what does it do?<br /> <br /> -Dicepool: What is if none of the supernatural type are there is it then an uncontested roll?<br /> <br /> -Costs: IF the power emulated has some costs do these also apply in some form to the demon?<br /> <br /> -Successes: What is if the roll would have been contested is the 1-3 succs then the END result or only the result of the<br /> diceroll itself?<br /> <br /> -What powers:<br /> Can only things like disciplines,... be emulated or also teh drinking of blood, healing like a vampire, making a blood bond,...?<br /> (if the later is possible what about blood bonds because &quot;lasts as it normally would&quot; does that mean a full blood bond is possible <br /> if this power is evoked 3 times and then the victim takes 3 dips from your blood?)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T09:01:15-08:00","id":349068,"title":"","content":"Dice Pool: If there are no observers, yes. It's uncontested.<br /> <br /> Costs: As-written, Show of Power costs the same regardless of the power it emulates. Any cost in Mana, Pyros, etc. is included in the one Aether cost of Show of Power. It's an Exploit, though, so it's going to provoke a compromise every time, and I'd say a ST is within his rights to levy penalties on this compromise roll if a demon spoofs a huge, noisy power (like Tier 3 Utterance) or uses the Exploit multiple times in the same scene (maybe use &quot;number of times equal to Primum&quot; as a &quot;safe&quot; number of uses).<br /> <br /> I suppose if the power has an ongoing cost during the power's duration (&quot;while this spell lasts, you can spend 1 Mana to do X as a reflexive action&quot;), it's probably fair to rule either that the extra &quot;spend Mana/Glamour/etc.&quot; benefit isn't accessable except with an additional use of Show of Power or to charge a like amount of Aether whenever that add-on is invoked. For some powers where not having to spend Mana (or whatever) won't completely break your game it's probably okay to ignore the extra cost entirely.<br /> <br /> Successes: I didn't address contested rolls/defenses. I'd say that if the demon wins the contest on the activation of Show of Power, she successfully spoofs the power. However, she counts as only having gotten one success more than her opponent for the purposes of the effect. If it's the kind of situation that would normally provoke Clash of Wills, run the Clash of Wills separately after determining whether Show of Power succeeds or fails.<br /> <br /> What Powers: Show of Power is intended to allow a demon to convincingly pretend to be another type of supernatural being. Any capability the absence of which would betray the demon as a fraud should be reasonably covered by Show of Power. I think I would probably cluster basic capabilities under a single aegis for the sake of simplicity - one Aether to take on all the qualities of a corpse (bashing damage from bullets, doesn't breathe, etc.), one Aether to render your blood addictive (allowing a blood bond that is very real), etc. The changes only last a scene, which limits the Exploit's utility somewhat, but I'd say the effects (the blood bond, a spell whose duration hasn't yet elapsed, etc.) can outlast the demon's ability to recreate the effect without another use of Show of Power.<br /> <br /> Hope that helps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":1094,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","user":"Eric Zawadzki","date":". 12-24-2014, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T00:44:36-08:00","id":349689,"title":"","content":"Hi tnx for the answer. Cool then the power was intended to work about the same as I thought it was (just wasn't sure and thus the question). Tnx alot!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T08:18:54-07:00","id":881811,"title":"","content":"I'm a bit curious though if the following (seeing it currently in a game) is the intended behaviour / usage of this power?<br /> <br /> A demon posing as a human is watching the other splats in the group and their power usage. Whenever one of them uses a power he makes notes on the sheet to add this power to his list of powers he can use. Then while still posing as a human he uses powers from different splats via &quot;show of power&quot;. <br /> <br /> Am I completely overlooking here something? Or is that really how this power is to be used?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T09:01:40-07:00","id":881868,"title":"","content":"Additional question(s):<br /> <br /> What is a good &quot;limit&quot; on what a Show Of Power Gadget is capable of? Restrict to a single power? Single classification of powers (Death Arcanum, Mesmerism Transmutations, etc.)? Single source of power (Vampire powers, Mage powers, etc.)?<br /> <br /> Show Of Power can mimic Instant and Inherent abilities, but not Extended. Would something like Garau's &quot;Regen all Bashing and Lethal&quot; be eligible? A Promethean/Mummy's &quot;Return from Death&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T10:19:59-07:00","id":881945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881868#post881868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Additional question(s):<br /> <br /> What is a good &quot;limit&quot; on what a Show Of Power Gadget is capable of? Restrict to a single power? Single classification of powers (Death Arcanum, Mesmerism Transmutations, etc.)? Single source of power (Vampire powers, Mage powers, etc.)?<br /> <br /> Show Of Power can mimic Instant and Inherent abilities, but not Extended. Would something like Garau's &quot;Regen all Bashing and Lethal&quot; be eligible? A Promethean/Mummy's &quot;Return from Death&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Regeneration is very possible, only on a turn by turn basis, meaning you'd have to activate Show of Power each time you want to use Garu's op healing. Promethean/Mummy ressurection on the other hand.. I would say that cannot be replicated, neither could one safely utilize things like master level Arcanum spells ( I say they can use them.. but be ready for the fall out)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T10:39:55-07:00","id":881965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881945#post881945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Regeneration is very possible, only on a turn by turn basis, meaning you'd have to activate Show of Power each time you want to use Garu's op healing. Promethean/Mummy ressurection on the other hand.. I would say that cannot be replicated, neither could one safely utilize things like master level Arcanum spells ( I say they can use them.. but be ready for the fall out)</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmmm good point do the replicated mage spells generate paradox like normal? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T10:57:42-07:00","id":881983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881965#post881965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmm good point do the replicated mage spells generate paradox like normal? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>at lower levels I would say no, as it is in essence a replication and not the true spell. But with spells of that level of power.. I think it begins to intrude too much in matters Supernal, and the universe should respond accordingly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:01:03-07:00","id":881986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881868#post881868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Additional question(s):<br /> <br /> What is a good &quot;limit&quot; on what a Show Of Power Gadget is capable of? Restrict to a single power? Single classification of powers (Death Arcanum, Mesmerism Transmutations, etc.)? Single source of power (Vampire powers, Mage powers, etc.)?<br /> <br /> Show Of Power can mimic Instant and Inherent abilities, but not Extended. Would something like Garau's &quot;Regen all Bashing and Lethal&quot; be eligible? A Promethean/Mummy's &quot;Return from Death&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>For general werewolf healing it'd last a scene per use but for the guru region I'd say it'd be an effect that'd occur once with show of power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:16:17-07:00","id":882002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881986#post881986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For general werewolf healing it'd last a scene per use but for the guru region I'd say it'd be an effect that'd occur once with show of power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no, not the guru healing!! anything but the divine restoration of one's mind and spirit at one time! The HORRORRRRRRRR D:<br /> <br /> Joking aside, that sounds fair","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:22:16-07:00","id":882012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881986#post881986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For general werewolf healing it'd last a scene per use but for the guru region I'd say it'd be an effect that'd occur once with show of power.</div> </div> </div> </div>So say you make a Wolf-skin Gadget that applies it repeatedly?<br /> <br /> Can a Beast's initial Positive Reaction be copied? Can Satiety costs be paid with Aether (despite being completely different Fuels, mechanically)? Can the Lair get copied (even though it is kinda a Power stat, it also is a &quot;power&quot; Demon's would need to imitate to infiltrate successfully)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:26:36-07:00","id":882024,"title":"","content":"I have a question too: can observers use their their supernatural senses to detect that the Exploit is fake? Or does a Success come with an automatic Spoofing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:26:43-07:00","id":882025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=882012#post882012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So say you make a Wolf-skin Gadget that applies it repeatedly?<br /> <br /> Can a Beast's initial Positive Reaction be copied? Can Satiety costs be paid with Aether (despite being completely different Fuels, mechanically)? Can the Lair get copied (even though it is kinda a Power stat, it also is a &quot;power&quot; Demon's would need to imitate to infiltrate successfully)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah.. you have fun getting that skin buddy. I'll be over here, in my bolthole, in another timeline.<br /> <br /> With Beasts I think the basic answer would be &quot;No&quot;, but I also think it's up to the storyteller.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:27:23-07:00","id":882026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=882012#post882012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So say you make a Wolf-skin Gadget that applies it repeatedly?<br /> <br /> Can a Beast's initial Positive Reaction be copied? Can Satiety costs be paid with Aether (despite being completely different Fuels, mechanically)? Can the Lair get copied (even though it is kinda a Power stat, it also is a &quot;power&quot; Demon's would need to imitate to infiltrate successfully)?</div> </div> </div> </div>The cost form another energy CAN be paid via aether yes.<br /> See here:<br /> <a href=\"http://rpg.stackexchange.com/questions/53392/clarifications-about-the-demonic-exploit-show-of-power\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpg.stackexchange.com/questio...-show-of-power</a><br /> Or just the first answer in this thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:36:40-07:00","id":882044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=882025#post882025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah.. you have fun getting that skin buddy. I'll be over here, in my bolthole, in another timeline.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's an Exploit - it doesn't need to be a <i>real</i> wolf skin. It's just more thematic doing it that way than Exploiting, I don't know, a pocket watch for your Uratha inspired super-regen.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=882025#post882025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With Beasts I think the basic answer would be &quot;No&quot;, but I also think it's up to the storyteller.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the way I see it, there ain't no rule that says &quot;except Beasts&quot;, so baring inherent restrictions on the power, they're fair game. My question's about some of the mechanics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T11:40:17-07:00","id":882049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/345693-show-of-power-power-questions?p=881811#post881811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a bit curious though if the following (seeing it currently in a game) is the intended behaviour / usage of this power?<br /> <br /> A demon posing as a human is watching the other splats in the group and their power usage. Whenever one of them uses a power he makes notes on the sheet to add this power to his list of powers he can use. Then while still posing as a human he uses powers from different splats via &quot;show of power&quot;.<br /> <br /> Am I completely overlooking here something? Or is that really how this power is to be used?</div> </div> </div> </div>Btw anything here?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"lin